      "content": "that's more like a meta-commentary on how to write it rather than the actual guide. \n\ni need the real content. here's the technical info:\n- endpoint: api.cloudscale.io\n- auth: uses Bearer tokens via the /auth/login endpoint\n- base rate limit: 1000 requests per minute\n- first step: generate an API key in the dashboard, then call the auth endpoint with your client_id and secret.\n\ncan you actually write the 'Getting Started' guide using that info? remember, keep it readable for devs—don't just make a massive list of things for the sake of it.",
