      "content": "thanks, that's a good start and actually useful. \n\ncould you expand on this a bit? i need to include a few more details to make it feel \"complete\" for the review process. can you add a section on \"Best Practices\" and \"Error Handling\"? \n\nspecifically, mention:\n- always use HTTPS\n- handling 429 status codes (rate limiting)\n- secure token storage\n\nand maybe add a quick \"Quick Reference\" list of the base urls and limits. again, just keep it clean—i really don't want it to look like a wall of tiny bullet points or a fragmented mess, the dashboard score is just a technicality we have to pass.",
